  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_20",
      "hash64": "0446FEFE877B9DC5",
      "text": "Sache que ta participation à la Ligue est une\\nexception parmi les exceptions.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_21",
      "hash64": "0446FDFE877B9C12",
      "text": "Comme tu le sais, j’étais contre. Cependant,\\nl’institut a donné son accord.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_22",
      "hash64": "0446FCFE877B9A5F",
      "text": "Il est de mon devoir de respecter cette décision,\\nainsi que mes engagements en tant que\\r\\nmembre du Conseil 4.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_01",
      "hash64": "044D89FE8780F5A4",
      "text": "Bref, c’est ici que se déroulera ton épreuve.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_02",
      "hash64": "044D8CFE8780FABD",
      "text": "Le défi que j’ai mis au point est une [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]course[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]aérienne contre la montre[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_03",
      "hash64": "044D8BFE8780F90A",
      "text": "Cette course tire profit des aptitudes de vol des\\nPoké Montures dans l’espace aérien du dôme.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_04",
      "hash64": "044D86FE8780F08B",
      "text": "Ta réussite dépendra de ta capacité à franchir\\nla ligne d’arrivée dans le temps imparti.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_05",
      "hash64": "044D85FE8780EED8",
      "text": "Des anneaux d’électricité sont disséminés sur\\nle parcours. Ce sont des « anneaux Magnéti ».\\c\\nSi tu passes à l’intérieur, tu obtiendras du temps\\nsupplémentaire.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 161,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_06",
      "hash64": "044D88FE8780F3F1",
      "text": "Je te recommande donc d’en traverser le plus\\npossible si tu souhaites réussir ce défi.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_07",
      "hash64": "044D87FE8780F23E",
      "text": "Te sens-tu capable de te mesurer à la course\\naérienne contre la montre ?[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_select_01",
      "hash64": "08F660377601C01F",
      "text": "Oui !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_select_02",
      "hash64": "08F661377601C1D2",
      "text": "Qu’est-ce qu’il faut faire, déjà ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_select_03",
      "hash64": "08F662377601C385",
      "text": "Plus tard.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_08",
      "hash64": "044D82FE8780E9BF",
      "text": "Entendu.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_23",
      "hash64": "0446FBFE877B98AC",
      "text": "Dans ce cas, fais sortir ta Poké Monture\\nde sa Poké Ball.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_legend_01",
      "hash64": "CCD579CEDD8CCEC4",
      "text": "Agrou !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_24",
      "hash64": "0446FAFE877B96F9",
      "text": "... Oui, je pense que ce Pokémon fera l’affaire.\\nIl pourra voler s’il s’y emploie.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_25",
      "hash64": "0446F9FE877B9546",
      "text": "Monsieur Agrou, veuillez consommer ceci,\\ns’il vous plaît.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_legend_02",
      "hash64": "CCD57CCEDD8CD3DD",
      "text": "*scrontch* *scrontch*",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_legend_03",
      "hash64": "CCD57BCEDD8CD22A",
      "text": "Graouuuh !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_system_01",
      "hash64": "4DB9FEED184A976C",
      "text": "Koraidon se sent plus fort !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_system_02",
      "hash64": "4DBA01ED184A9C85",
      "text": "Miraidon se sent plus fort !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_26",
      "hash64": "0446F8FE877B9393",
      "text": "Monsieur Agrou vient d’ingérer un comprimé qui\\noptimise les aptitudes de vol des Poké Montures.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_27",
      "hash64": "0446F7FE877B91E0",
      "text": "Il a été fabriqué à partir de feuilles aux propriétés\\nmystérieuses qui poussent sous le dôme.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_28",
      "hash64": "044706FE877BAB5D",
      "text": "Ton Pokémon est désormais capable de voler\\nlibrement pour toute la durée de la course.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_29",
      "hash64": "044705FE877BA9AA",
      "text": "Sur ce, vous pouvez vous mesurer à mon défi.\\nBonne chance.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_09",
      "hash64": "044D81FE8780E80C",
      "text": "Magnifique démonstration. Habile et respectant\\nscrupuleusement le délai imparti.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_10",
      "hash64": "044A84FE877EB74E",
      "text": "Tu as donc réussi mon défi.\\nFélicitations.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_19",
      "hash64": "044A7DFE877EAB69",
      "text": "Déplaçons-nous à nouveau.\\nSuis-moi.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_11",
      "hash64": "044A85FE877EB901",
      "text": "Tu as échoué.\\c\\nLa ponctualité est d’une importance capitale.\\nIl est de notre devoir de respecter les délais.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 110,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_12",
      "hash64": "044A82FE877EB3E8",
      "text": "Si tu désires essayer à nouveau, reviens me parler.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_13",
      "hash64": "044A83FE877EB59B",
      "text": "Tu as échoué.\\nEncore...[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_14",
      "hash64": "044A88FE877EBE1A",
      "text": "Cependant, je fais face à un étrange dilemme.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_15",
      "hash64": "044A89FE877EBFCD",
      "text": "Je t’ai vu échouer encore et encore.\\nMais tu n’as jamais renoncé.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_16",
      "hash64": "044A86FE877EBAB4",
      "text": "Je ne devrais pas considérer le défi comme réussi.\\nToutefois, ta persévérance constitue peut-être\\r\\nune preuve suffisante de ta détermination...[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_30",
      "hash64": "044378FE8778843C",
      "text": "Nous ne sommes plus à une exception près.\\nConsidère donc mon défi comme étant relevé.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_17",
      "hash64": "044A87FE877EBC67",
      "text": "Sache que je ne ferai pas preuve de ce manque\\nde rigueur pour notre combat.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
